+// XHTTP deliberately detaches request cancellation for long-lived streams.
+// Bound only creation of a NEW transport connection so a peer that accepts
+// TCP and then stalls TLS/REALITY cannot park the Android attempt forever.
+// Once this function returns a live connection, stream lifetime semantics
